{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-control-batch-diagnosis","title":"细胞质控、双细胞与环境 RNA 诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/singlecell-assay-data-model/quality-control-batch-diagnosis","wordCount":2736,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"细胞质控-双细胞与环境-rna-诊断\">细胞质控、双细胞与环境 RNA 诊断</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单细胞转录组的第一道工程关卡不是聚类，而是<strong>判定哪些液滴里的条码（barcode）配得上被称为一个细胞</strong>。10x Genomics Chromium 这类微流控平台把细胞与凝胶珠共包裹进油包水液滴，一个 3&#39; 或 5&#39; 文库通道的原始产出里，真正的细胞只占少数——大部分液滴根本不含细胞，却仍然捕获了游离的 mRNA。若不先做质控，这些空滴、死细胞碎片、双细胞和环境 RNA 会直接污染下游的降维与注释，让一个本应代表「一个细胞转录状态」的矩阵变成噪声的混合体。</p>\n<p>质控要回答四个彼此独立的问题：<strong>这个液滴是不是细胞</strong>（空滴过滤）、<strong>它是不是两个细胞的黏连</strong>（双细胞检测）、<strong>背景里混进了多少别人的 mRNA</strong>（环境 RNA 校正）、<strong>这个细胞是不是濒死或状态异常</strong>（指标阈值过滤）。前两个问题决定哪些行（细胞）保留，后两个问题决定矩阵里的数值是否需要修正。它们在不同工具、不同坐标系下运作，工程上不能合并成一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始 barcode 矩阵&lt;br/&gt;Raw_feature_bc_matrix] --&gt; B{空滴判定&lt;br/&gt;EmptyDrops / 细胞调用}&#10;    B --&gt;|擦除| X[丢弃非细胞液滴]&#10;    B --&gt;|保留| C[环境 RNA 估计&lt;br/&gt;SoupX / CellBender]&#10;    C --&gt; D[双细胞检测&lt;br/&gt;Scrublet / scDblFinder / Solo]&#10;    D --&gt; E[指标阈值过滤&lt;br/&gt;nFeature / 线粒体 / 核糖体 / 血红蛋白]&#10;    E --&gt; F[下游归一化与聚类]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始 barcode 矩阵&lt;br/&gt;Raw_feature_bc_matrix] --&gt; B{空滴判定&lt;br/&gt;EmptyDrops / 细胞调用}\n    B --&gt;|擦除| X[丢弃非细胞液滴]\n    B --&gt;|保留| C[环境 RNA 估计&lt;br/&gt;SoupX / CellBender]\n    C --&gt; D[双细胞检测&lt;br/&gt;Scrublet / scDblFinder / Solo]\n    D --&gt; E[指标阈值过滤&lt;br/&gt;nFeature / 线粒体 / 核糖体 / 血红蛋白]\n    E --&gt; F[下游归一化与聚类]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诊断任务</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n<th>输入层</th>\n<th>主要统计依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空滴过滤</td>\n<td>EmptyDrops、Cell Ranger <code>--force-cells</code></td>\n<td>原始 barcode 矩阵</td>\n<td>Dirichlet-多项式似然检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境 RNA 校正</td>\n<td>SoupX、CellBender、decontX</td>\n<td>原始计数矩阵</td>\n<td>背景 soup 轮廓 + 污染比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双细胞检测</td>\n<td>Scrublet、DoubletFinder、scDblFinder、Solo</td>\n<td>过滤后计数矩阵</td>\n<td>模拟双细胞的最近邻分数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标阈值</td>\n<td>scater <code>isOutlier</code>、Scanpy <code>sc.pp.filter_cells</code></td>\n<td>已调用细胞</td>\n<td>MAD 自适应阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"液滴气泡判定与空滴过滤\">液滴气泡判定与空滴过滤</h2><p>Cell Ranger 的早期版本用一条硬阈值把 UMI 总数 ≥ 10 的 barcode 当作细胞；这个启发式在低 RNA 含量的细胞类型（如某些免疫细胞、神经元）上会直接把它们误杀。Cell Ranger 3.0（2019）起改用 <strong>EmptyDrops</strong> 算法（Lun 等，<em>Genome Biology</em> 2019，doi:10.1186/s13059-019-1662-y），把「空滴」建模为从全体 barcode 的 UMI 分布拟合出的背景轮廓，再对每个 barcode 做 Dirichlet-多项式似然比检验，判断其表达谱是否显著偏离背景。只有偏离足够显著的 barcode 才被判为细胞。</p>\n<p>这一改动的工程后果很实在：调用出的细胞总数不再等于加载细胞数，而是变成一个<strong>需要报告的自由参数</strong>。10x 官方文档建议 3&#39; 试剂盒在细胞回收数（recovered cells）上按目标加载量估算，但实际调用数受细胞类型 RNA 含量影响可上下浮动 20%–40%。如果下游分析对细胞数敏感（例如稀有细胞类型的比例），必须把 EmptyDrops 的 FDR 阈值连同调用细胞数一起写入方法学。</p>\n<p>一个常见的误用是同时用 <code>--force-cells</code> 强行指定细胞数。这等于用先验覆盖统计判定，会让真正的低 RNA 细胞和背景噪声的边界变得不可审计。正确做法是：先看 EmptyDrops 的 UMI 排序曲线是否存在清晰的「膝点（knee）+ 平台」结构，膝点处对应的 UMI 数量级就是细胞/空滴的分界线。</p>\n<p>设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 barcode 的基因计数向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，背景轮廓为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\pi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，EmptyDrops 检验的是该 barcode 是否来自一个与背景不同的多项分布，其对数似然比为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">π</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">π</mi><mtext>ambient</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda_i = \\log \\frac{P(\\mathbf{x}_i \\mid \\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\pi}}_i)}{P(\\mathbf{x}_i \\mid \\boldsymbol{\\pi}_{\\text{ambient}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ambient</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>拒绝原假设（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显著大）的 barcode 才进入下一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环境-rna-与污染校正\">环境 RNA 与污染校正</h2><p>「环境 RNA」（ambient RNA / soup）指细胞裂解释放到液滴外、又被其他液滴随机捕获的转录本。它在矩阵里表现为<strong>所有细胞背景里都出现的、弥散的、与细胞类型无关的表达</strong>——最典型的是在非肝细胞里读到白蛋白（ALB），在非免疫细胞里读到免疫球蛋白，或在任何组织里都读到高丰度的线粒体与核糖体基因。这类污染会把稀有细胞类型的标记基因「抹」到背景细胞上，导致注释时出现虚假的表达。</p>\n<p>主流校正方法有三类，思路不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SoupX</strong>（Young &amp; Behjati，<em>GigaScience</em> 2020，doi:10.1093/gigascience/giaa151）用真实空滴（未通过细胞调用的液滴）估计 soup 轮廓，再估计每个细胞簇的污染比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，最后按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}_{ij} = \\max(0, c_{ij} - \\rho \\cdot s_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 从每个细胞的每个基因里扣除背景读数。</li>\n<li><strong>CellBender remove-background</strong>（Fleming 等，<em>Nature Methods</em> 2023，doi:10.1038/s41592-023-01943-7）用深度生成模型同时做空滴过滤与背景扣除，输出一张「干净」计数矩阵。</li>\n<li><strong>decontX</strong>（Yang 等，<em>Genome Biology</em> 2020，doi:10.1186/s13059-020-1950-6）用贝叶斯混合模型估计每个细胞的污染比例，适合与 SingleCellExperiment 工作流集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上最关键的是<strong>污染比例估计</strong>这一步的可解释性。SoupX 会报告每个细胞簇的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，健康样本通常在 1%–5%，组织解离剧烈或冻融样本可能到 10%–20%。若某个簇的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 异常高，往往提示该簇本身就是低 RNA 含量的「背景样」细胞群，而不是真的细胞类型。此时应先回到上一步确认细胞调用是否过宽，而不是盲目加大扣减力度——过度扣减会引入负偏，把真实的低表达信号一并抹掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双细胞检测\">双细胞检测</h2><p>双细胞（doublet）是两个细胞被同一个液滴包裹，其转录谱是两个细胞表达的叠加。10x Genomics 的官方文档给出的多重率估算约为「每 1000 个加载细胞约 0.8%」，在加载 10,000 个细胞时约 7.6%。这意味着一个 10,000 细胞的 PBMC 数据集里可能有几百个双细胞，它们会在 UMAP 上落在两个真实簇之间，或者被聚类算法当成一个「新颖」的中间态。</p>\n<p>设加载细胞数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，期望双细胞比例可用泊松模型近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.008</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 0.008 \\times \\frac{N}{1000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.008</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>主流检测工具都基于「模拟双细胞 + 打分」范式，区别在打分器与分类器：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Scrublet</strong>（Wolock 等，<em>Cell Systems</em> 2019，doi:10.1016/j.cels.2018.11.005）对每个细胞的表达谱模拟人工双细胞，用最近邻图上的双细胞分数加一个由模拟分布自动确定的阈值来判定。</li>\n<li><strong>DoubletFinder</strong>（McGinnis 等，<em>Cell Systems</em> 2019，doi:10.1016/j.cels.2019.03.003）假设双细胞在 PCA 空间里分布在真实细胞之间，用人工双细胞的比例（pK）生成的经验分布做分类。</li>\n<li><strong>scDblFinder</strong>（Germain 等，<em>F1000Research</em> 2022，doi:10.12688/f1000research.73600.2）用随机森林在模拟双细胞上训练，对多样本/多通道支持最好，是当前 Bioconductor 单细胞流程（OSCA）的默认推荐。</li>\n<li><strong>Solo</strong>（Bernstein 等，<em>Cell Systems</em> 2020，doi:10.1016/j.cels.2020.08.014）用半监督变分自编码器，在低维隐空间里判定双细胞。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型经验：单样本、细胞数 &lt; 5,000 时 Scrublet 足够；多样本、需要跨样本一致阈值时用 scDblFinder；若下游是 Seurat，DoubletFinder 与 Seurat 工作流衔接最顺。<strong>无论哪个工具，都必须在每个通道（channel/lane）内独立运行</strong>——跨通道混合会因批次效应让模拟双细胞分布失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质控指标阈值与-mad-自适应过滤\">质控指标阈值与 MAD 自适应过滤</h2><p>细胞调用完成、环境 RNA 校正后，最后一层是<strong>指标阈值过滤</strong>。常用的逐细胞指标有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>nFeature_RNA（检出基因数）</strong>：过低说明是碎片或空滴残留，过高提示双细胞。</li>\n<li><strong>nCount_RNA（总 UMI 数）</strong>：与 nFeature 高度相关，用来抓极端值。</li>\n<li><strong>线粒体基因比例（percent.mt）</strong>：高比例意味着细胞膜破损、mRNA 外泄而线粒体转录本相对滞留，是濒死/损伤细胞的标志。这是<strong>组织依赖</strong>的：PBMC 常用 5%–10% 上限，实体组织（心肌、肝脏）因为本身线粒体转录本丰度高，上限常放宽到 15%–25%。</li>\n<li><strong>核糖体基因比例（percent.ribo）</strong>：过高提示细胞状态异常或技术偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>血红蛋白基因（HBB/HBA1/HBA2）</strong>：在非红细胞样本里出现高表达，通常是全血带来的红细胞污染。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>手工写死阈值（例如「一律 percent.mt &lt; 20」）在异质队列上会系统性偏差。scater 包（McCarthy 等，<em>Bioinformatics</em> 2017，doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btw777）提供的 <code>isOutlier()</code> 用**中位数绝对偏差（MAD）**做自适应阈值，对每个指标同时设上下界：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MAD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>upper</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>MAD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAD} = \\operatorname{median}\\left(\\left| x_i - \\operatorname{median}(x) \\right|\\right), \\qquad t_{\\text{upper}} = \\operatorname{median}(x) + n \\cdot \\text{MAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">upper</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>。这套方法的好处是阈值随样本自身分布缩放，跨数据集可复现；坏处是当某个指标本身分布极偏（例如线粒体比例在低质量样本里整体抬高）时，MAD 会把真正的坏细胞一起放过。工程实践是<strong>两条腿走路</strong>：先用 MAD 给出去绝对离群点，再叠加一个生物学硬上限（如 percent.mt ≤ 30%），防止自适应阈值被污染分布带偏。</p>\n<p>下面是 Scanpy 上 MAD + 硬上限组合过滤的最小骨架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;import scanpy as sc&#10;&#10;adata = sc.read_10x_h5(&quot;filtered_feature_bc_matrix.h5&quot;)&#10;adata.var_names_make_unique()&#10;&#10;# 标记线粒体与血红蛋白基因&#10;adata.var[&quot;mt&quot;] = adata.var_names.str.startswith(&quot;MT-&quot;)&#10;adata.var[&quot;hb&quot;] = adata.var_names.str.match(r&quot;^HB[AB]&quot;)&#10;sc.pp.calculate_qc_metrics(&#10;    adata, qc_vars=[&quot;mt&quot;, &quot;hb&quot;], percent_top=None, log1p=False, inplace=True&#10;)&#10;&#10;def mad_bounds(x, n=3.0):&#10;    med = np.median(x)&#10;    mad = np.median(np.abs(x - med))&#10;    return med - n * mad, med + n * mad&#10;&#10;lo_g, hi_g = mad_bounds(adata.obs[&quot;n_genes_by_counts&quot;])&#10;lo_c, hi_c = mad_bounds(adata.obs[&quot;total_counts&quot;])&#10;lo_m, hi_m = mad_bounds(adata.obs[&quot;pct_counts_mt&quot;])&#10;&#10;keep = (&#10;    adata.obs[&quot;n_genes_by_counts&quot;].between(lo_g, hi_g)&#10;    &amp; adata.obs[&quot;total_counts&quot;].between(lo_c, hi_c)&#10;    &amp; (adata.obs[&quot;pct_counts_mt&quot;] &lt; min(hi_m, 30.0))   # MAD 与生物学硬上限取严&#10;)&#10;adata = adata[keep].copy()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scanpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sc.read_10x_h5(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"filtered_feature_bc_matrix.h5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adata.var_names_make_unique()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 标记线粒体与血红蛋白基因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adata.var[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adata.var_names.str.startswith(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MT-\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adata.var[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adata.var_names.str.match(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">HB</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[AB]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sc.pp.calculate_qc_metrics(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adata, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qc_vars</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">percent_top</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">log1p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inplace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mad_bounds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    med </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.median(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mad </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.median(np.abs(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> med))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> med </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad, med </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lo_g, hi_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad_bounds(adata.obs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"n_genes_by_counts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lo_c, hi_c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad_bounds(adata.obs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_counts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lo_m, hi_m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad_bounds(adata.obs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pct_counts_mt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">keep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adata.obs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"n_genes_by_counts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].between(lo_g, hi_g)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adata.obs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_counts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].between(lo_c, hi_c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (adata.obs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pct_counts_mt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hi_m, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MAD 与生物学硬上限取严</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adata[keep].copy()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里对线粒体比例取 <code>min(MAD 上界, 30)</code>：MAD 通常更严，但在整体质量差的样本上硬上限兜底，避免自适应阈值完全失效。过滤后<strong>必须回读剩余细胞数并重新跑一次细胞调用曲线</strong>，确认没有把某个细胞类型整体剔除——这是质控最容易翻车的地方：阈值一收紧，稀有细胞类型（如树突状细胞、固有淋巴样细胞）常常成批消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>质控是四件独立的事：空滴过滤、环境 RNA 校正、双细胞检测、指标阈值过滤，顺序不能随意对调——先扣背景再判双细胞，会把污染当成真实表达。</li>\n<li>空滴判定用 EmptyDrops 这类统计检验（Cell Ranger ≥ 3.0 默认），不要用 <code>--force-cells</code> 覆盖；报告调用细胞数时同时给出方法。</li>\n<li>环境 RNA 校正先看污染比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 的分布，健康样本多在 1%–5%；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 异常高往往意味着细胞调用过宽，而非需要更狠地扣减。</li>\n<li>双细胞检测在<strong>每个通道内独立</strong>运行，工具按样本复杂度选：Scrublet（单样本）、scDblFinder（多样本）、DoubletFinder（Seurat 流程）。</li>\n<li>阈值用 MAD 自适应 + 生物学硬上限组合，线粒体比例阈值高度组织依赖（PBMC 5%–10%，实体组织可到 25%）。</li>\n<li>任何过滤后都要回看细胞类型构成，确认没有成批误杀稀有细胞——这是质控从「跑通」到「可信」的分界线。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本章数据模型与预处理流程见 <a href=\"./\">章节索引</a> 与 <a href=\"../\">hub 总索引</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"细胞质控、双细胞与环境 RNA 诊断","id":"细胞质控-双细胞与环境-rna-诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"液滴气泡判定与空滴过滤","id":"液滴气泡判定与空滴过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"环境 RNA 与污染校正","id":"环境-rna-与污染校正"},{"level":2,"text":"双细胞检测","id":"双细胞检测"},{"level":2,"text":"质控指标阈值与 MAD 自适应过滤","id":"质控指标阈值与-mad-自适应过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表达矩阵与 AnnData/Seurat 数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/singlecell-assay-data-model/expression-matrix-data-structure"},"next":{"title":"归一化、方差稳定与高变基因选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/normalization-hvg-model"}}